── UNKNOWN NAME ────────────────────────────── E0211_python_len.lt:3:11  [E0211]

Stilt has no `len` function: a length is a method, as `xs.len()`:

  3 │   print("{len(xs)} items")
    │           ^^^

Lists, maps, sets and strings have a `len` method.

To fix it, call the method `len`:

  3 │   print("{xs.len()} items")
    │           ~~~~~~~~
